Spec: Agent server-authority verification

Purpose:
  Verify standard server leases independently at the actual publishing Agent before business admission.

Owns:
  ./README.md

Structure:
  ./dotnet: Portable .NET lease verification and monotonic authorization windows.
  ./java: Portable Android-compatible lease verification.

References:
  /control-plane/authority/lease.sdd
  /docs/SECURITY-SPEC.md

Must:
  Keep server tokens and authority dependencies inside Agent components, outside thin business SDKs.
  Require current authenticated control snapshots and server epoch as external trust inputs; never derive trust from token claims.
  Use mature JWS implementations with fixed ES256 and exact-scope validation, preserving certificate checks and monotonic expiry.
